        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 37,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "For they shall soon be cut down like the grass, and wither like the green herb.",
      "ko": "저희는 풀과 같이 속히 베임을 볼 것이며 푸른 채소 같이 쇠잔할 것임이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "25c8a9b650de6b066be9ae5761be176c50828f0832748ef95fba78bfe79fbb0a",
      "translation_text_hash": "f5473e2c5a35c7afae83667e836f6a89e2babedcc5957047bcc70b1f83655c91",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희는 풀과 같이 속히 베임을 볼 것이며 푸른 채소 같이 쇠잔할 것임이로다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f5473e2c5a35c7afae83667e836f6a89e2babedcc5957047bcc70b1f83655c91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:37:3",
      "sequence": 14454,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 37",
      "verse_label": "3",
      "locator": {
